   <div class="content">
    
	
	<div id="mascot">
		<div id="welcome">
	  	<span>&lsquo;&lsquo;</span>
    	<h1>WELCOME,</h1>
    	<div>BandAMP&trade; provides a friendly community of musicians who challenge each other in the desire to improve. Check out our <a href="http://forum.bandamp.com/">Forums</a> and of course the <a href="http://browse.bandamp.com/hall_of_fame.html">Hall of Fame</a>&hellip; We&rsquo;re glad you made it, enjoy!
	    	<h2><b><u>Listen to these artists:</u></b><br> <a href='http://takaminerbb13.bandamp.com/amp.html?xml=takaminerbb13.bandamp.com/music.xml&webID=takaminerbb13.bandamp.com/music.html'>takaminerbb13</a>, <a href='http://BTSmusic.bandamp.com/amp.html?xml=BTSmusic.bandamp.com/music.xml&webID=BTSmusic.bandamp.com/music.html'>BTSmusic</a>, <a href='http://dkturner.bandamp.com/amp.html?xml=dkturner.bandamp.com/music.xml&webID=dkturner.bandamp.com/music.html'>dkturner</a>, <a href='http://SoundsLikeJustice.bandamp.com/amp.html?xml=SoundsLikeJustice.bandamp.com/music.xml&webID=SoundsLikeJustice.bandamp.com/music.html'>SoundsLikeJustice</a>, <a href="http://forum.bandamp.com/Audio_Review.html" class="welcome">more...</a></h2>
      	<div class="myclear">&nbsp;</div>
      	<h2>
        <!-- <b>Support BandAMP</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr?cmd=_xclick&business=bandamp@poppyshop.org&item_name=Bandamp Donation&no_shipping=0&no_note=1&tax=0&currency_code=USD&lc=US&bn=PP-DonationsBF&charset=UTF-8" class="welcome" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="images/donation.gif" alt="Donate!"></a> -->
        <a href="http://www.youtube.com/user/BandAMPOfficial" class="welcome" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="images/YouTube Icon PNG.png" width="300px" align="center" title="Follow Bandamp on Youtube" alt="Follow Bandamp on Youtube"></a>
        </h2>
    	</div>
  	</div>
  	<div class="myclear">&nbsp;</div>
	</div>
  <div id="player">
		  <div id="DivMP3PlayerFX"></div>
      <script type="text/javascript" src="http://www.bandamp.com/scripts/mp3-player/swfobject.js"></script>
