	<div id="annc">
		<div id="anncHead">
  		<a href="http://forum.bandamp.com/Announcements.html"><h1><b>recent news</b></h1></a>
    	<h3>What&rsquo;s new with BandAMP?</h3>
  	</div>
  	<div class="annc">
      <div class="dateBox">
       <h3>tue</h3>
       <h1>01</h1>
       <h2>jan</h2>
      </div>
      <h2><a href="http://forum.bandamp.com/Announcements/41746.html">HAPPY NEW YEAR 2013</a></h2>
      <div class=abbc>... to all members of Bandamp.com.<br>
<br>
We hope that all your wishes and dreams come true this year. Some of us have made a great development. Bandamp is proud to be a part of their career. Our thoughts are with them and with those who will never reach the goal (RIP Flyer). But Bandamp also will stay at the side of those who need help in developing their ideas and their skills.<br>
Now let's start together doing your MOYL, the MUSIC OF YOUR LIFE</div>
     </div>
     <div class="anncFoot">
      <span>by <a href="http://TritonKeyboarder.bandamp.com/" class="mod" title="">TritonKeyboarder</a> <font>@</font> 6:46 PM</span>
      <div><a href="http://forum.bandamp.com/Announcements/41746.html">comments (2)</a></div>
     </div><div class="annc">
      <div class="dateBox">
       <h3>thu</h3>
       <h1>13</h1>
       <h2>dec</h2>
      </div>
      <h2><a href="http://forum.bandamp.com/Announcements/41610.html">It's Christmas time again</a></h2>
