      <h2><a href="http://forum.bandamp.com/Announcements/38334.html">NEW "VIDEO REVIEW" FORUM!!</a></h2>
      <div class=abbc><b>Hey Bandampers! </b>Now you have a place to put your own original video creations! Take a look at our new <b>VIDEO REVIEW</b> forum! This will be dedicated to the uploading of your videos for comment and critique (Just think, no more uploading them to "The Pit!"). Remember: because we don't have a dedicated video player here on the site, you will have to upload your video to YOUTUBE first, and then follow the little tutorial found here: <a href="http://forum.bandamp.com/Questions/27177.html" target='_blank'>http://forum.bandamp.com/Questions/27177.html</a>. <b>Check it out!!</b></div>
