      <h2><a href="http://forum.bandamp.com/Announcements/37302.html">STOP SOPA and PIPA!!!!!!!</a></h2>
      <div class=abbc>To all American Bandamp members: Congress is currently pursuing some legislation that will likely radically change our access to information on the Internet (in the proposed interest of stopping Internet piracy). Youtube, Google, Wikipedia, will be grossly altered (and smaller sites like our dear Bandamp might be crippled). Please take a second to visit the two links below and voice your opposition to SOPA and PIPA. The legislation is just days away!!!<br>
<br>
<a href="https://www.google.com/landing/takeaction/" target='_blank'>https://www.google.com/landing/takeaction/</a><br>
<br>
<a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Main_Page" target='_blank'>http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Main_Page</a></div>
